<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia jobs market signs positive-Vanstone.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia jobs market signs positive-Vanstone.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanstone said on Thursday signs for the labour market were positive after June employment data showed a drop in the unemployment rate to 8.5 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The signs for the labour market are positive,&quot; Vanstone said in a statement.</p>
</text>
